  "name": "E20. Compare with overall average",
  "rawText": "# Question: Which sellers exceed 1000 in completed-order revenue, and how do they compare with the average?\n# Answer: Combined: a context, a join, a filter, a window function, sort and Take in one query.\nSellerRevenue is OrderItems: Order.Seller.Id SellerId,\n    SUM(Quantity * UnitPrice).Round(2) Revenue,\n    Count(Id) LineCount\n  Where Order.Status = \u003CCompleted\u003E\nSeller:\n  Inner Join SellerRevenue On Id = SellerRevenue.SellerId\n  Select Id,\n    FirstName,\n    LastName,\n    SellerRevenue.Revenue Revenue,\n    SellerRevenue.LineCount LineCount,\n    AverageOver(SellerRevenue.Revenue).Round(2) AverageSellerRevenue\n  Where SellerRevenue.Revenue \u003E \u003C1000\u003E\n  Order Revenue DESC\n  Take 10",
